# Codebase X-Ray — environment variables
#
# Everything here is server-side only. Never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_:
# anything named NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the browser bundle.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
#   A GitHub token raises the REST quota from 60 to 5,000 requests per hour.
#   Without it the app still works, but a single scan costs ~26 requests and
#   GitHub's unauthenticated quota is shared per source IP.
#   Scopes needed for public repositories: none (a classic token with no
#   scopes, or a fine-grained token with public read access, is sufficient).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
